# Build context is the repo root. Send only what the images need.
*
!apps/server
!data/grammar
# The web app is built into the server image (see the web stage in apps/server/Dockerfile).
!package.json
!pnpm-lock.yaml
!pnpm-workspace.yaml
!.npmrc
!tsconfig.base.json
!apps/app
!packages/api-client
!packages/core

# Local build/spike output never goes into the image; the web stage rebuilds everything.
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/dist-web*
**/.turbo
**/.expo
apps/server/bin
apps/server/scripts
apps/server/Dockerfile
